Hello <%= @invitee.name.presence || @invitee.email %>,

You are invited to <%= @event.title %>.

Date: <%= @event_date %>
Time: <%= @event_time %>
Organizer: <%= @host.full_name.presence || @host.email %>
Location: <%= @event.location.presence || @meeting_link || "Online" %>
Description: <%= @event.description.presence || "No description provided" %>

Accept: <%= @accept_url %>
Decline: <%= @decline_url %>
Maybe: <%= @maybe_url %>

<% if @unregistered_invitee %>
You can review and respond to this invitation without logging in.
View invitation: <%= @view_invite_url %>
Optional signup: <%= @signup_url %>
<% end %>
